# Xcode
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
DerivedData/
.build/
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/

# Only relevant once a real .xcodeproj exists here (see README) —
# xcuserdata/xcuserstate are per-developer scheme/window state, never
# meant to be shared.

# Signing (mirrors android-tv/'s keystore.properties handling — never
# commit certs/provisioning profiles). Signing.xcconfig itself IS
# committed (see README.md) — it only ever holds a Team ID, not a
# credential, and xcodegen needs it to exist to generate the project.
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
